# === model_artifacts/live_text_test.py ===
# SenseFuzeAI - Live Text Model Test GUI
#
# Presentation-first version:
#   - main output shows concise prototype-friendly result
#   - technical details are available through "Show Technical Details"
#   - exports include both summary and full diagnostic information
#
# This script tests the trained text model generated by:
#   train_text_model.py
#
# Required files:
#   model_artifacts/text_model.joblib
#   model_artifacts/text_model_meta.json
#
# Behaviour prediction:
#   raw text -> TF-IDF features -> best selected classifier
#
# Sentiment prediction:
#   rule-based lexical sentiment scoring
#
# Export support:
#   - JSON full diagnostic result
#   - CSV compact summary
#   - TXT human-readable report

